, and VHS effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Steam Deck Verified with full controller support</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every loop brings you closer to understanding what is happening in Level 0. But the deeper you go, the stranger everything begins to feel.</p>", "short_description": "An anomaly-spotting horror game set in Level 0 of the Backrooms. Study the looping corridor and identify changes ranging from subtle details to terrifying entities. Decide to turn back if something has changed, or continue ahead if everything seems normal.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Afrikaans, Albanian, Belarusian, Bosnian, Catalan, Croatian, Estonian, Filipino, Galician, Hebrew, Hindi, Icelandic, Latvian, Lithuanian, Macedonian, Malay, Persian, Serbian, Slovak, Slovenian", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451970/39173f4616e7a9f77f12a059398657d862550725/header_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1787699622", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451970/d8f743e2154c22256d8d25173067fe1dbe4652b6/capsule_231x87_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1787699622", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3451970/d8f743e2154c22256d8d25173067fe1dbe4652b6/capsule_184x69_alt_assets_2.jpg?t=1787699622", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><st